{"id": "5b326988-9cf7-447c-8519-4002945eb0fa", "slug": "data-infrastructure-platform", "title": "Data Infrastructure Platform", "description": "Data Infrastructure Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Data Infrastructure Platform\"\ndescription: \"Data Infrastructure Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#A855F7\"\n  secondary: \"#2A2933\"\n  accent: \"#C084FC\"\n  background: \"#2A2933\"\n  surface: \"#E9D5FF\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#2A2933\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Data Infrastructure Platform\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 38; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated.\n## Overview\nData Infrastructure Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nDesigned for every data team Start for free For your Lead Data Scientist Advanced predictive modeling workflows Automated feature engineering pipelines Model performance drift detection For your Data Engineer For your P…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Designed for every data team; For your Lead Data Scientist; For your Data Engineer; For your Product Manager; For your Governance Lead; Featuring bank-grade compliance and ironclad infrastructure.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #A855F7, secondary #2A2933, accent #C084FC, background #2A2933, surface #E9D5FF, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Data Infrastructure Platform</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #0d0c14;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            margin: 0;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n        \n        /* Subtle background grid */\n        .bg-grid {\n            background-image: \n                linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),\n                linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 32px 32px;\n        }\n\n        /* Custom scrollbar for webkit */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 8px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n            background: #0d0c14;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: #2a2933;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-20 sm:py-32\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL-style Canvas Animation Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Background Grid Lines -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none bg-grid mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom,transparent,black,transparent)\"></div>\n    \n    <!-- Full width horizontal decorative lines -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-[#2a2933] z-0 opacity-50\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute top-1/3 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-[#2a2933] z-0 opacity-50\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute top-2/3 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-[#2a2933] z-0 opacity-50\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-1/4 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-[#2a2933] z-0 opacity-50\"></div>\n\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-[1000px] px-4 sm:px-6 z-10\">\n        \n        <!-- Top Section -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 border border-[#2a2933] bg-[#0d0c14]/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-sm relative overflow-hidden\">\n            \n            <!-- Absolute Pixel Graphic Decoration (Static replication of reference) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/4 flex gap-1 items-end z-0 hidden sm:flex\">\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#d8b4fe] opacity-80\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-transparent\"></div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-purple-500 opacity-90\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#c084fc]\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#a855f7]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#e9d5ff]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#d8b4fe]\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#e9d5ff]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-indigo-500\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-blue-600\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Left Column: Headline & CTA -->\n            <div class=\"p-8 sm:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-[#2a2933] relative z-10 min-h-[300px]\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white max-w-[280px] leading-tight\">\n                    Designed for every data team\n                </h1>\n                \n                <div class=\"mt-12 sm:mt-0\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-black px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium rounded-sm hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors duration-200\">\n                        Start for free\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Column: Roles List -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col relative z-10 bg-[#0d0c14]/90 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                \n                <!-- Active Item -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 border-b border-[#2a2933] bg-[#13121a]/50\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"text-purple-400 mt-0.5\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-circle-linear\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">For your Lead Data Scientist</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-gray-400 list-disc list-inside marker:text-gray-600\">\n                                <li>Advanced predictive modeling workflows</li>\n                                <li>Automated feature engineering pipelines</li>\n                                <li>Model performance drift detection</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Inactive Items -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 border-b border-[#2a2933] hover:bg-[#13121a]/30 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"text-gray-500 group-hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-200 transition-colors\">For your Data Engineer</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-6 border-b border-[#2a2933] hover:bg-[#13121a]/30 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"text-gray-500 group-hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:graph-up-linear\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-200 transition-colors\">For your Product Manager</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-6 hover:bg-[#13121a]/30 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"text-gray-500 group-hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-200 transition-colors\">For your Governance Lead</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Section -->\n        <div class=\"mt-12 border border-[#2a2933] bg-[#0d0c14]/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-sm p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-8\">\n            \n            <!-- Absolute Pixel Decoration -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/4 flex gap-1 z-0 hidden md:flex\">\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#c084fc] absolute -top-12 left-24 opacity-80\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-blue-600 absolute -top-6 left-32\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#e9d5ff] absolute top-12 left-0 opacity-90\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#a855f7] absolute -top-16 right-[-200px] opacity-70\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Text -->\n            <div class=\"max-w-[360px] relative z-10\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-snug\">\n                    Featuring bank-grade compliance and ironclad infrastructure\n                </h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Badges -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 relative z-10\">\n                <!-- Badge 1 -->\n                <div class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-full border border-gray-600 bg-[#121118] flex items-center justify-center flex-col text-center shadow-lg\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-widest text-white leading-tight mt-1\">ISO<br>27001</span>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Badge 2 -->\n                <div class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-full border border-gray-600 bg-[#121118] flex items-center justify-center flex-col text-center shadow-lg relative p-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:global-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"text-gray-300 mb-1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-[8px] font-semibold tracking-widest text-gray-300\">GDPR</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Bottom gradient bar -->\n    <div class=\"fixed bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-12 flex z-50 pointer-events-none opacity-80\">\n        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-gradient-to-t from-purple-900/40 to-transparent\"></div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-gradient-to-t from-blue-900/40 to-transparent\"></div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-gradient-to-t from-purple-800/40 to-transparent\"></div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-gradient-to-t from-indigo-900/40 to-transparent\"></div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-gradient-to-t from-purple-900/40 to-transparent\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Simple WebGL-style Canvas Animation for background blocks\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        \n        let width, height;\n        const blocks = [];\n        const colors = ['#8B5CF6', '#6366F1', '#A855F7', '#C084FC', '#4F46E5', '#ffffff'];\n        const blockSize = 24;\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = window.innerHeight;\n            canvas.width = width;\n            canvas.height = height;\n            initBlocks();\n        }\n\n        function initBlocks() {\n            blocks.length = 0;\n            const cols = Math.ceil(width / blockSize);\n            const rows = Math.ceil(height / blockSize);\n            \n            // Only create blocks in certain areas to match the aesthetic\n            for (let i = 0; i < 40; i++) {\n                blocks.push({\n                    x: Math.floor(Math.random() * cols) * blockSize,\n                    y: Math.floor(Math.random() * rows) * blockSize,\n                    color: colors[Math.floor(Math.random() * colors.length)],\n                    opacity: Math.random(),\n                    targetOpacity: Math.random(),\n                    speed: 0.005 + Math.random() * 0.02\n                });\n            }\n        }\n\n        function animate() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n            \n            blocks.forEach(block => {\n                // Update opacity\n                if (Math.abs(block.opacity - block.targetOpacity) < 0.01) {\n                    block.targetOpacity = Math.random() * 0.5; // Keep max opacity low\n                }\n                \n                if (block.opacity < block.targetOpacity) {\n                    block.opacity += block.speed;\n                } else {\n                    block.opacity -= block.speed;\n                }\n\n                ctx.globalAlpha = block.opacity;\n                ctx.fillStyle = block.color;\n                ctx.fillRect(block.x, block.y, blockSize, blockSize);\n            });\n            \n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        resize();\n        animate();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "data-infrastructure-platform.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/data-infrastructure-platform.jpg", "source_name": "data-infrastructure-platform-DESIGN.md", "views": 62, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T06:15:36.917009+00:00"}